{"version":1,"content":"<p>凌晨1時許，青馬管制區職員報案指發現一輛七人車停在往屯門方向的路肩，懷疑有人從橋面墮海。</p><p>救援人員接報到場在附近一帶海面展開搜索，水警其後將一名男子救起，35歲姓姜男事主昏迷，由救護車送往仁濟醫院，經搶救證實不治。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T04:20:33.972528+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T03:41:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T10:57:40.581072+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T04:17:49.156324+00:00","content_hash":"2816eb0adccdbe9f0bef2d534826a70ee6f3bc5870ba29da3328f2d5487209b6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}